{"articleNo":"561941","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=561941&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 5월 '사랑 나눔 사랑의 헌혈' 실시 안내","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.05.12","hit":"8542","attachments":[{"name":"1. 단체헌혈안내자료(2025.10.1).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=561941&attachNo=163836"},{"name":"2. 헌혈필수안내문(2025.8.13).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=561941&attachNo=163837"},{"name":"3. 헌혈자 기념품 안내(2026.1.1).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=561941&attachNo=163838"},{"name":"4. 헌혈가능조건(2026.1.1).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=561941&attachNo=163839"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 5pt 0px 0px 16.5pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -16.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">소중한 생명이 위협받지 않고 안정적인 혈액공급이 이루어질 수 있도록 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">단체헌혈</span>을 실시하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 5pt 0px 0px 16.5pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -16.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈에 적극 협조하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 5pt 0px 0px 16.5pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -16.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">05.15.(금), 05.20.(수) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">10:30~16:30</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">학생회관 옆 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">B </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">구역 주차장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대한적십자사 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈버스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><b>협조사항</b></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">신분증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">주민등록증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">운전면허증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">학생증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">모바일신분증 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">지참</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나. \"</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">레드커넥트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">\" </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">스마트폰 헌혈앱 설치 권고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">전자문진 및 검사결과 조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>기타사항</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈시 봉사시간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">시간 인정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">사회복지자원봉사인증관리시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(VMS) </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">연계</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈자 건강체크</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">혈액검사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">혈액형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">간염</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">간기능 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">ALT, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">총단백 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 다. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈자 대상 헌혈증서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">기념품</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">급식품 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 라. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">오전 헌혈 접수마감 시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 11:30 (11:30~12:00 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈진행</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 마. 오후 헌혈 접수시작 시간: 13:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;바. 오후 헌혈 접수마감 시간: 16:00</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">5. <b>학교 생명나눔 헌혈왕 챌린지 실시</b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;1) 운영기간: 2026. 3월~ 2027. 2월&nbsp;</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;2) 참가대상: 학생 및 교직원</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;3) 내용: 연간 헌혈 참여우수자 및 헌혈증 기부자에 대한 포상&nbsp; 실시 예정</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;4) 참여 접수: 2학기 중 </span></font><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">실시 예정</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
